definition.description:
When the owner of a dynamic channel leaves it, Vertix waits a while before offering the channel to whoever is still inside. They then vote on who takes it over.

Pick a value below to change it. A value marked {defaultMarker} follows the bot's own configuration rather than a choice made here, and an empty field puts it back to that.

**🚪 Owner Away Before Claimable** ∙ {valueClaimTimeout}
How long the owner can be gone before the channel is offered to the others.

**🔁 Claim Check Interval** ∙ {valueClaimInterval}
How often Vertix looks for abandoned channels, which is also how close to the wait above the offer actually lands.

**🗳️ Vote Duration** ∙ {valueVoteTimeout}
How long a claim vote stays open once it starts.

**➕ Vote Time Per Candidate** ∙ {valueVoteAddTime}
Added to the running vote each time someone new puts themselves forward.

